---
title: 'Five minutes before the quiz'
slug: 'class-play-five-minute-warmup'
date: 2026-08-22
excerpt: 'One Class Play Quick Quiz as a warmup. Students join with a code or QR.'
tags: ['advice', 'class-play', 'teacher-tip']
author: 'Patrick'
---

Teachers do not need a new curriculum.

Before a doctrinal mastery check, host one casual Quick Quiz. Project the board. Students join from their phones with the four-letter code or a QR scan. That is the whole setup.

Free hosts get one casual game a week (up to six students). Premium unlocks rooms of thirty and more games. Students always join free.

Save the class once — first names as seats — and they pick their name next period. No accounts. No retyping the roll.

Keep it reverent. The verse sticking is the point.
